#: editor.py:381
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Click edges on the model or the paper layout to cut or join them; click a tab to move it to the other side; Shift+click a tab to glue it on the outside (printed with the art it covers); click an open edge (or Ctrl/Alt+click) to add or remove a flap for joining parts. Cuts and joins wait for Apply Cuts unless Live Layout is on. Press again, right-click or Esc to finish"
msgstr "在模型或纸张排版上单击边以切开或连接；单击粘贴边可将其移到另一侧；Shift+单击粘贴边可将其粘在外侧（连同其覆盖的图案一起打印）；单击开放边（或 Ctrl/Alt+单击）可添加或移除用于连接部件的翼片。除非开启实时排版，否则切口和连接要等应用切口后才生效。再次按下、右键单击或按 Esc 完成"

#: ops.py:148
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Create (or rebuild) an armature with a driven hinge on every fold, so the sheet can fold up and fly onto the model. Rebuilding keeps your keyframes"
msgstr "创建（或重建）骨架，为每条折痕添加由驱动器控制的铰链，使纸张能折起并飞到模型上。重建会保留你的关键帧"

